      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In this note we look at the influence of a shallow, uneven riverbed on a soliton. The idea consists in an approximate transformation of the equation governing wave motion over an uneven bottom to an equation for a flat one for which the exact solution exists. The calculation is one space dimensional, and so corresponds to long trenches or banks under wide rivers or oceans."},
